{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844730/extras/titlebar_story.png?t=1737417051\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On a typical night, an accident unexpectedly brings you to a goddess. You want to go back to your normal life and negotiate in many ways, but in the end, you become an &quot;ISEKAI Truck Driver&quot; !!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The job of a ISEKAI Truck Driver is to assist the goddess in transporting the specified target to the other world, when the other world is in turmoil and the goddess needs to summon heroes. And how do you transport them? By driving a truck enhanced by the goddess and hit the target!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the story, there are five goddesses from different worlds who need your assistance. As the tasks are completed, the communication between you and the goddesses will make your relationship closer. If you fulfill the goddesses' needs, you may even engage in deeper interactions with them?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, through contact with various goddesses, you slowly realize that this world seems different from what you imagined. Is there a way to return to your normal life?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844730/extras/titlebar_goddesses.png?t=1737417051\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844730/extras/goddessespic_daphne.png?t=1737417051\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844730/extras/goddessespic_ruri.png?t=1737417051\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844730/extras/goddessespic_elara.png?t=1737417051\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844730/extras/goddessespic_aurora.png?t=1737417051\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844730/extras/goddessespic_minerva.png?t=1737417051\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844730/extras/titlebar_howtoplay.png?t=1737417051\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player will drive around the city while the goddess sits in the passenger seat, directing the player towards specified targets. Players must find and hit the specified targets within the given time. If the time limit is exceeded, the target becomes invalid, and the goddess will assign a new target to the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level requires a certain number of heroes. If the player achieves within the time limit of level, the level will be passed. Otherwise, the level will fail. Players must hit the targets one after another to complete the level task.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2844730?t=1737417051","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844730/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1737417051","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844730/d4a630d5861a88e374680e93b2e11500c3528bd2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1737417051","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844730/d4a630d5861a88e374680e93b2e11500c3528bd2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1737417051","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"Character is over the age of 20.\r\nContent Warning: \